    "# Offline Speech-to-Speech LLM System\n",
    "## Complete Voice Assistant Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Dr. Fouad Bousetouane  \n",
    "**Assignment:** Week 6 - Build an End-to-End Voice Assistant\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements a complete speech-to-speech AI pipeline that:\n",
    "1. **Records/Uploads** audio (your question)\n",
    "2. **Transcribes** speech to text using Whisper\n",
    "3. **Reasons** about the question using a local LLM (TinyLlama)\n",
    "4. **Synthesizes** the answer back to speech using SpeechT5\n",
    "5. **Plays back** the generated audio response\n",
    "\n",
    "All components run **offline** in Google Colab!\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
