    "# Task 2: Speech-to-Text with Whisper\n",
    "\n",
    "## Goal\n",
    "Use OpenAI's Whisper model to transcribe the recorded audio into text.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Model Selection\n",
    "Whisper comes in multiple sizes:\n",
    "- `tiny`: Fastest, least accurate (~39M parameters)\n",
    "- `base`: Good balance (~74M parameters)\n",
    "- `small`: Better accuracy (~244M parameters)\n",
    "- `medium`: High accuracy (~769M parameters)\n",
    "- `large`: Best accuracy (~1550M parameters)\n",
    "\n",
    "We'll use `base` for a good speed/accuracy trade-off in Colab."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load Whisper model\n",
    "print(\"📥 Loading Whisper model...\")\n",
    "whisper_model = whisper.load_model(\"base\", device=device)\n",
    "print(f\"✅ Whisper 'base' model loaded on {device}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n📝 Model details:\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Parameters: ~74M\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Supports: 99 languages\")\n",
    "print(f\"   Task: Transcription & Translation\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Transcribe audio\n",
    "print(\"🎙️ Transcribing audio with Whisper...\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "result = whisper_model.transcribe(\n",
    "    audio_file_path,\n",
    "    language=\"en\",  # Force English (remove for auto-detection)\n",
